# Generated Go code IS committed on purpose.
#
# Every Go service consumes it through the `github.com/opus-casino/proto`
# module (see the `replace` directive in each services/go/<name>/go.mod), so the
# generated packages must be part of the module and versioned with the .proto
# files they come from. Run `buf generate` from this directory to regenerate.
#
# Local-only scratch output stays ignored:
/gen/rust/

